HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_b964c, ", `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_26d3ad06, "`, is for the program and is not UTF-8, and `heroes run` passes a program's arguments as Heroes `str`s, which are UTF-8 (spec \302\247 3 Types)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_b13f1b1, "note: build the program with `heroes build`, run it with this argument, and read it with `args_checked()`");
