HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_124d888c, "` of `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_644e9362, "` is a word nothing reads \342\200\224 `@` hands the caller's place to change it and `lent` hands it to read, so write one: `@");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_36283b3b, "` where the function changes it, `");
