HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_8864383, "`when ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6ba447, "` compares the result of `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1830ef62, "` with a value of another type: the result is `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_48cd0703, "`, and the clause takes an integer literal for an integer result and `true` or `false` for a `bool`");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_32eaaa4f, "success_without_end");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1022d6a, "`when` says which result means `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1e7d01fc, "` did what it was handed, and no parameter of it is marked `consumes`, `transfers` or `retains`: nothing here happens only on success");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5f41db1b, "` is a handle, and a handle that comes back null is the call's own failure: a `retains` or `acquires` result needs no clause and takes none");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_594117dc, "success_value_range");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5e8583dd, "` with a value it can never hold: the result is ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5736b8ea, ", which holds ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_69d5805f, "a clause that is never true ends, transfers and retains nothing: clang warns that the comparison is always false, every handle the call took stays owed, and the program aborts when `main` returns over a handle never given back. Write the value the header returns, or declare the result at the width the header gives it");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5165e3a4, "this type");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_779f26eb, "unread_mark");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_198b5b1e, "` on ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_53671c, " is a word nothing reads: ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5fa4a519, " reaches no handle, so no rule can say which call hands the value over or takes it back, and the word could be false without anything noticing");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1e02a775, "the marks are read on a handle \342\200\224 a group `record` with a `tag` and no fields \342\200\224 and on a value reaching one through its fields. Name the C type the pointer stands for and mark that: `record Block tag void` is C's `void *`, `record AI tag addrinfo` is `struct addrinfo *`, and the compiler writes `struct` where the header needs it");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_c993728, "on a handle the word does work: `acquires` must name an `extern` that takes one back with `consumes`, `consumes` refuses a value the caller only borrowed, and a handle nobody gives back aborts when `main` returns, naming its address. On a `ptr` none of that can happen, and a wrong word there was measured to free memory `malloc` never gave");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4fd9a3d1, "this node has no written type");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_19b88e88, "no extern of this program takes one back");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3cc93bce, "says the call ends the life of the `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5bc9fbfe, "` it takes in");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_345d0244, "says the call hands the life of the `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1411627a, "` it takes in into another value");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4bac0728, " inside `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_12778267, "cell_cannot_end");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5ebf4cce, "` on `@");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3d878a03, ", and `@` says the opposite: `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3158a988, "` is a cell `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_14e402dc, "` writes into, where the `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6c1dee79, "` comes out to the program");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_35c4ac07, ", and a cell that receives a handle cannot end one");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3d5cbc6e, "say how the handle the cell receives begins, with a mark on the cell: `acquires <releaser>` if the program owes its release, or `borrows` if the library keeps it. If `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_a443680, "` really takes the handle in, drop the `@`: a parameter written without it hands the value to C, and `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7833a0e4, "` reads there");
