HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_21aa5b49, ", do not survive the call, and its result begins no life");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4dc0d6e6, "transfer_without_receiver");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_76fb9ba0, "` is marked `transfers`, and the call has nowhere to hand the life to: ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_2a106bec, "a transfer hands a value INTO another value that will end it later \342\200\224 json-c's `json_object_object_add(obj, key, val)` puts `val` under `obj`, OpenSSL's `BIO_new_fp(stream, flags)` keeps `stream` inside the BIO it returns");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7cd60401, "a call with one handle and no acquiring result ENDS the value instead: mark it `consumes`, and if it is one more way to end what a call begins, name it in that call's mark, `acquires <releaser> | ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3a28ed48, "a receiver survives the call, so the life it took can end later through it; a parameter marked `consumes` or `transfers` is gone when the call returns and keeps nothing. If `");
