HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1e59516, "\302\247 13: a group's constants are the values C computes, read by running the module's own unit with clang's checks before the program links; a header whose code ends or holds a process before `main`, a constructor that exits or a read of stdin, ends or holds that run, and the program it would build the same way");
