HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_a6720cf, " \342\200\224 C reads what a call hands it there as whatever type it asks for, so nothing holds it to the `const` the lend promises");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4402a041, "\302\2474.19: a record lent read-only is the caller's own place, which C may read and never write; past a header's `...` the header declares no type for it, so neither clang nor this compiler can hold C to the `const`, and a write there changes a value the program declared unchanged");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5fe94cf0, "` and declares a `static inline` function taking `");
